\f1\fs22 The hospitality marquee kept Chanta and he let it. It was full of his people\'97all the musos knew him as the Great Teacher whether they\'92d met him or not, and the prettiest Elvisettes giggled about his Enchanted Cleaning Services despite the evidence that he never looked like cleaning up after himself. They didn\'92t mind; they were enthusiastic with their attentions whenever opportunities presented, which included bringing him beers and potions and mirrored platters bearing white powders. Around mid-afternoon, Chanta stopped rolling his one-and-only hundred-dollar note; he\'92d been experiencing out-of-body experiences unrelated to the Elvisettes, and suspected the nose Christmas might have something to do with it.\
\pard\pardeftab720\fi360\sl220\qj\partightenfactor0

